name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q14_2026'

question 'A student rewrites an eligibility rule to be more fair. Their teacher asks: "In a real product, who would have to approve a change like this before it ships?" Which answer best captures the idea that accountability is shared?'

wrong 'Only the engineer who wrote the code.'
wrong 'Only the AI tool that suggested the rule.'
wrong 'Only the user, after they complain.'
right 'A combination of people — engineers, designers, legal review, and often the community affected by the rule.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

